error[E0125]: a type parameter cannot be a reserved word
 --> test-code/errors/front/E0125-type-parameter-invalid.mu:3:25
  |
1 | package errors
2 |
3 | identity :: proc(value: $if) Int ->
  |                         ^^^ this is a reserved word
4 |     return 0
  |
  = note: a type parameter is a '$' directly followed by a name, and the name is not a reserved word
